// owns the whole crate, a file path inside a crate owns that one file (so the
// large ravel-server crate can be split by concern). stats.js (generated by
// scripts/archmap/gen_stats.py, `make archmap`) is aggregated onto modules by
// longest matching prefix, so counts and the dependency chips stay current
// when this file does not change. Crate dependencies attach to the module
// that owns the crate root.
//
// When you move a file or crate, update `paths` here. When you add a flow,
// list the module ids it crosses in order; the page routes and animates it.
// Keep prose plain and specific. Cite files a reader should open first.
